Package: hoopvalue
Title: Measure NBA Player Value with Advanced Analytics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Benjamin Mathew", email = "18mathewbs@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for measuring the value of NBA players with advanced
    statistics. Includes functions for shooting efficiency, for converting
    raw totals to per 100 possession rates so players on fast and slow teams
    can be compared fairly, and for combining several advanced statistics
    into one overall value score. Ships with 2025-26 regular season totals
    for every NBA player.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
